CFG551 Tasks 2-3: predicted splashback-radius ratio (framework / LCDM) per published measurement, the confrontation, controls.

Implements FROZEN_CRITERIA.md (b1b7c9e08).
Inputs (read-only): ../CFG546_drained_shell_cluster_lensing/cfg546_predict_results.json (rho_g templates, S0 stack),
  cfg546_predict_MUTATE_results.json (shuffled-centre template), cfg546_forecast_results.json (linear r_sp shifts),
  ../CFG495_drawdown_shell/cfg495_sim_analysis_results.json (V6), ../CFG504_smooth_halo_transition/cfg504_calib_results.json (K-S0),
  cfg551_ptemplate_results.json (particle templates, this lane), cfg551_measurements.json (compilation, this lane).
Outputs: cfg551_predict.out / cfg551_predict_results.json; CFG551_MUTATE=1 -> cfg551_predict_MUTATE.out / _results.json.

== K-S0 (gate): DK14 pipeline (3D, sigma_bin 0.05, 0.2-10 Mpc/h, priors) on CFG504 S0 512^3 stacks vs colossus more15
   S0_512_a R3: log M_ta 14.24, log M200m 13.98 (r_ta-matched 13.97); r_sp fit 2.955 = 2.69 r200m; more15 1.299 -> ratio 2.274 (r_ta-matched mass: 2.280); DK14 fiducial 1.383 -> ratio 2.137; chi2 51.6
   S0_512_a R4: log M_ta 14.59, log M200m 14.33 (r_ta-matched 14.32); r_sp fit 4.298 EDGE = 3.00 r200m; more15 1.625 -> ratio 2.645 (r_ta-matched mass: 2.647); DK14 fiducial 1.756 -> ratio 2.447; chi2 72.0
   S0_512_b R3: log M_ta 14.23, log M200m 13.97 (r_ta-matched 13.95); r_sp fit 2.908 = 2.67 r200m; more15 1.290 -> ratio 2.254 (r_ta-matched mass: 2.276); DK14 fiducial 1.371 -> ratio 2.121; chi2 70.3
   S0_512_b R4: log M_ta 14.60, log M200m 14.34 (r_ta-matched 14.35); r_sp fit 4.256 = 2.94 r200m; more15 1.640 -> ratio 2.595 (r_ta-matched mass: 2.585); DK14 fiducial 1.772 -> ratio 2.402; chi2 98.6
  [FAIL] K-S0 LCDM own ratio (S0 boxes / more15) in 0.85-1.15: S0_512_a|R3 2.274, S0_512_a|R4 2.645, S0_512_b|R3 2.254, S0_512_b|R4 2.595

